  "date": "2026-11-12T20:08:50Z",
  "subject": "fix(metal1): let ESO reach Vault through the operator's NetworkPolicies (#2029)",
  "body": "The openshift ESO operator isolates the operand with deny-all NetworkPolicies, so the\nvault-backend store timed out logging in. Allow the core controller egress to\nvault.marthy.xyz (nas ingress 192.168.20.1:443) via ExternalSecretsConfig\ncontrollerConfig.networkPolicies.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
}
